# The vendored libmdbx amalgamation is third-party code compiled into the
# package, not code this package's tests are meant to exercise. It is ~22k
# expressions against ~1k of first-party source, so counting it makes the
# overall figure a measure of libmdbx's internals rather than of this binding.
#
# covr reads this file automatically; the reusable coverage workflow calls
# covr::package_coverage() with no arguments, so this is the only hook.
src/vendor
